  "note": "2010-2024 sourced from exchange_calendars only (backfill; not independently verified). 2025-2026: exchange_calendars + exchange_publications. Weekend sessions are not modelled: exchange_calendars has 16 Russian make-up Saturdays in 2010-2024 (e.g. 2012-04-28, 2018-12-29, 2024-12-28) that the registry leaves out, as for every exchange (divergence_test skips weekend_days). 2022 equity-market suspension: the library treats 2022-02-28 to 2022-03-23 as normal sessions, but the Moscow Exchange equity market was closed by Bank of Russia decision from 28 February and resumed on 24 March 2022 (33 MOEX Russia Index stocks, 09:50-14:00; not encoded). The 16 closed weekdays are in holidays.explicit (as one-off closures are elsewhere, e.g. XNYS 2025-01-09), citing moex.com notices n43337 (28 Feb), n43882 (1 Mar) and n45535 (resumption on 24 Mar), and are listed in contradicted_by on the exchange_calendars span. Regular hours (4b2, ADR 0013/0014; morning and evening sessions are additional sessions, not regular hours): 10:00-18:45 from 2010 (unconfirmed), closing auction to 18:50 from 2013-09-02 (MOEX notice of 23 August 2013), closing auction to 19:00 from 2026-03-23 (notice of 11 February 2026), main session from 09:00 with continuous trading from 09:10 for shares without a morning session from 2026-09-14 (notice of 14 August 2026). Evidence in verification.hours.",
